  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "S.D. of a series is unaltered if each observation is increased (or reduced) by the same scalar quantity, S.D. is independent of change of origin.<br />Hence, S.D. will be the same.<br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> S.D. <math><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math>",
